                            "warstwa najbogatszych ludzi wpływających na rząd państwa"
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "literary"
                        ],
                        "examples": [],
                        "sense_index_json": "\"1.2\""
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "40dc3888-904c-44d1-af18-2561b5b3980a",
                        "source_entry_id": "a6314b67-3db7-3509-84bd-3f2472ad7ef8",
                        "source_sense_id": "2a55b98c-c567-32b6-af67-49f096ed21f4",
                        "target_lang_word": "plutocracy",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "plutocracy",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "279ec8b3-587b-3a60-8ccd-3f2c2d28ac59",
                                        "entry_id": "cd962455-33dc-329d-9639-307fde193466",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Government by the wealthy."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c1bf52e0-36f9-4dde-ab98-a38184ac62b3",
                                                "sense_id": "279ec8b3-587b-3a60-8ccd-3f2c2d28ac59",
                                                "text": "Plutocracy, which is virtually supreme to-day, is to be no less condemned ; for it is not only not just, bit is nearly as detrimental to the race at large as absolute socialism would be, if adopted […]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3b0c2647-83bb-4df6-8db3-622cea611745",
                                                "sense_id": "279ec8b3-587b-3a60-8ccd-3f2c2d28ac59",
                                                "text": "Modernity is not democracy; machinery is not democracy; the surrender of everything to trade and commerce is not democracy. Capitalism is not democracy; and is admittedly, by trend and savour, rather against democracy. Plutocracy by definition is not democracy. But all these modern things forced themselves into the world at about the time, or shortly after the time, when great idealists like Rousseau and Jefferson happened to have been thinking about the democratic ideal of democracy."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "280ee3df-58b6-3d55-8efa-b6d8376d39fc",
                                        "entry_id": "cd962455-33dc-329d-9639-307fde193466",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A controlling class of the wealthy."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "51eb3c69-df47-4430-bd36-caf25b27aaa8",
                                                "sense_id": "280ee3df-58b6-3d55-8efa-b6d8376d39fc",
                                                "text": "“There are three big classes in society. First comes the Plutocracy, which is composed of wealthy bankers, railway magnates, corporation directors, and trust magnates. Second, is the middle class, your class, gentlemen, which is composed of farmers, merchants, small manufacturers, and professional men. And third and last comes my class, the proletariat, which is composed of the wage-workers."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "58078571-12ea-4e8d-ba3c-1ec228469e7b",
                                                "sense_id": "280ee3df-58b6-3d55-8efa-b6d8376d39fc",
                                                "text": "There, indeed, he must consent to be the puppet and plaything of plutocracy enthroned on machinery, to have his ears assaulted by every variety of beastly sound that the ingenuity of modern civilization can devise, and his peace of mind shattered by the continual necessity under which he finds himself of performing bodily convolutions that would do credit to a professional gymnast."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "81526d3c-f3a3-4c83-9146-4039d9b9ef0d",
                                                "sense_id": "280ee3df-58b6-3d55-8efa-b6d8376d39fc",
                                                "text": "The sea, most inhuman of elements, met in perfect friendship here with the soft and pleasure-loving side of man; and the mixed architecture of a bygone plutocracy reconciled me to the experiments of today."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2685fd81-0b6f-41c8-ab86-a5d187030013",
                                                "sense_id": "280ee3df-58b6-3d55-8efa-b6d8376d39fc",
                                                "text": "Her piece painted him as an enigmatic Jay Gatsby type, a boy from a middle-class family in Brooklyn who had scaled the rungs of the plutocracy, though no one could quite figure out how he made his money."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "8218abed-15eb-4fc1-a27e-8009235b420b",
                        "source_entry_id": "a6314b67-3db7-3509-84bd-3f2472ad7ef8",
                        "source_sense_id": "2a55b98c-c567-32b6-af67-49f096ed21f4",
                        "target_lang_word": "plutokracie",
                        "target_lang_code": "cs",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "plutokracie",
                                "target_lang_code": "cs",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "8819139e-d676-3d38-b9d3-d8e6921353aa",
                                        "entry_id": "9fce08cd-ab99-3073-9a9a-17f089a139f9",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "forma organizace společnosti, v níž vládne nejbohatší vrstva"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4ad12654-43c1-4a4b-9d5e-42e84eb0612c",
                                                "sense_id": "8819139e-d676-3d38-b9d3-d8e6921353aa",
                                                "text": "Plutokracie byla častou formou vlády ve starověkých městských státech, např. v Aténách."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "51c2ac4f-60e9-3003-b443-a180bb163367",
                                        "entry_id": "9fce08cd-ab99-3073-9a9a-17f089a139f9",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "nejbohatší vrstva společnosti"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "6251568f-39fa-468c-9bd1-25c3c5b8d2b1",
                        "source_entry_id": "a6314b67-3db7-3509-84bd-3f2472ad7ef8",
                        "source_sense_id": "2a55b98c-c567-32b6-af67-49f096ed21f4",
                        "target_lang_word": "ploutocratie",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "ploutocratie",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "a0dfbe26-7535-34f3-a4cb-6ef324623cab",
                                        "entry_id": "7e8369b7-47ac-3818-ba26-ca61df7ce02f",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "État d’une société dans laquelle les plus riches exercent plus ou moins directement le pouvoir politique ou jouissent d’une influence prépondérante."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3f1393f3-012b-43fa-a381-37955d4a2e7f",
                                                "sense_id": "a0dfbe26-7535-34f3-a4cb-6ef324623cab",
                                                "text": "Les demoiselles et les dames de la ploutocratie américaine ont atteint les dernières limites de cette sorte d’émancipation, elles métamorphosent leurs père et mari en accumulateurs de millions, qu’elles gaspillent follement."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "af3d5c43-2d40-4718-9aec-9c9f5545a76f",
                                                "sense_id": "a0dfbe26-7535-34f3-a4cb-6ef324623cab",
                                                "text": "De cent façons, New York et sa somptueuse ploutocratie répétaient Venise : dans la magnificence de son architecture, de ses arts, de ses édifices, dans le farouche acharnement de ses luttes politiques, dans sa suprématie commerciale et maritime."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f0550f99-5f4b-4147-bdc1-873968f57a9b",
                                                "sense_id": "a0dfbe26-7535-34f3-a4cb-6ef324623cab",
                                                "text": "La ploutocratie chilienne s’était appuyée sur deux forces : les milieux réactionnaires de la Marine et les intérêts impérialistes britanniques."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "56316c4d-f1b1-4a6e-a29d-9ece0fc5d0e3",
                                                "sense_id": "a0dfbe26-7535-34f3-a4cb-6ef324623cab",
                                                "text": "En fait, il [l’institution de l’Empire] s’agit d’un habit. L’essentiel est de préserver derrière cette façade les conquêtes en France de la Révolution : le principe de l’égalité, l’abolition des droits féodaux, la vente des biens nationaux, conquêtes qui ont permis d’établir au détriment de la vieille aristocratie une nouvelle ploutocratie."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "1f504f9a-351c-4018-b139-2e4e6ec63529",
                        "source_entry_id": "a6314b67-3db7-3509-84bd-3f2472ad7ef8",
                        "source_sense_id": "2a55b98c-c567-32b6-af67-49f096ed21f4",
